summary:
  The popup no longer learns the least width the face needs.

history:
  Plasma sizes the popup by the Layout hints of the item it was given, and
  that item is the seat. The least width is measured from the tab bar;
  without it the popup can be dragged narrower than the tabs, where My
  Music and Podcasts wrapped in the middle of the word.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PopupFace.qml

find:
      Layout.minimumWidth: face ? face.Layout.minimumWidth : 0

replace:
      Layout.minimumWidth: 0

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_popupface.qml::test_the_popup_reads_the_faces_four_hints_off_the_seat.
